 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? It does, actually. Dreaming in another language actively shifts your brain towards that language. That's the most exciting part. Your brain doesn't know the difference between a dream and real life when it comes to language. Yes, the more you expose yourself, the more you practice. Watch something you already know, like your favourite series, with subtitles on. Then you' already ahead of most beginners. Try recalling simple phrases as you wake up, that solidifies the connections.",
